  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Which of the following statements is/are TRUE?</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "wxWig",
      "text": "No a satisfies the above equation",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9PwTd",
      "text": "An integer a satisfies the above equation",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QrQ0A",
      "text": "An irrational number a satisfies the above equation",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4YyVR",
      "text": "More than one a satisfy the above equation",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So, the integral becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></menclose><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></menclose><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>33</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>33</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
